  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Vakati Srinivasulu, vs State Of Andhra Pradesh, on 30 March, 2021 Author: R. Raghunandan Rao Bench: R. Raghunandan Rao Hon'Ble Sri Justice R. Raghunandan Rao Crl.P.No.1720 of 2021 Order:",
    "facts": "The petitioner is accused in Crime No.235 of 2017 of Kavali II Town Police Station for the offences under Sections 353, IPC and Section 58 of the Food Safety & Standards Act, 2006 on the ground that the petitioner has stored tobacco and tobacco products stored in his house. After investigation the police had filed the charge sheet, which was numbered as C.C.No.230 of 2018 on the file of the Additional Judicial Magistrate of 1st Class, Kavali, SPSR Nellore District. The petitioner now sought for quashing of C.C.No.230 of 2018 on the file of the Additional Judicial Magistrate of 1st Class, Kavali, SPSR Nellore District. The cases are being booked against persons, who are found to be either storing or transporting tobacco and tobacco products, in the State of Andhra Pradesh. The persons, who are facing such cases, have been approaching this Court for relief.",
